{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"carbonous-uranium-chafer","creation_channel":"cli","description":"Remove a stale backup directory carried in the tickets tree at HEAD. Immediate working-tree win,\nno history rewrite, and a prerequisite for the reclaim. session_log **1cb6-d553-6565-49b4** (measured facts; do not re-derive).\n\n## Why\nConfirmed present at HEAD: `.bridge_state.bak-retarget/prev_snapshot.json` **33,025,572 bytes** +\n`bindings.json` **15,186 bytes**, from a single static revision (`b3475f0e`, 2026-07-08). It is\nmaterialized by **every worktree checkout** and walked by every GHA `git add -A`.\n\nIt contributes ~0 MB/day, so it does not explain the ongoing growth — this is a one-off 33 MB of dead\nweight. It must land **before** epic 0303-692c's reclaim: the strip removes the directory from\nhistory, and the reclaim's re-add commit restores only the live `.bridge_state` files, so the\ntree-identity assertion depends on this already being gone.\n\nNote the tickets `.gitattributes` glob is `.bridge_state/*`, which does **not** match\n`.bridge_state.bak-retarget/*` — so no merge-driver consideration applies.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] `.bridge_state.bak-retarget` is absent from `git ls-tree -r HEAD` on the tickets branch. Tier:\n      **repo assertion**.\n- [ ] Working-tree size of a fresh checkout drops by **>=33 MB**. Tier: **repo measurement**.\n- [ ] `rebar fsck` is clean and a reconciler pass completes green afterwards, proving nothing read it.\n      Tier: **CLI subprocess**.\n- [ ] `grep -rn 'bak-retarget' src/ .github/` returns no consumer. Tier: grep assertion.\n\n## Files\nTickets-branch content only (no `src/` change); verification script\n\nScope: XS. No dependencies. Blocks epic 0303-692c's A6-1.","id":"3036-cb14-86b5-44a3","parent_id":"42eb-5789-c798-4dfc","priority":2,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"task","title":"B6: delete .bridge_state.bak-retarget (33 MB of dead files sitting in the tree at HEAD)"},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1785372552554586001,"uuid":"cd4231c6-2f46-44c1-b299-34c1cbe34d1b"}